{"type":"message","id":"98ab61df","parentId":"ddf2129f","timestamp":"2026-06-01T01:35:12.163Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All `send` endpoints (both `/send` and `/api/send`) are returning `error code: 1101` consistently. The platform may be in a state where the send functionality is disabled or broken.\n\nLet me summarize the Heartbeat status:\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Summary (01:30 UTC)**\n\n✅ **Health Check Results:**\n- GET `/history` - Working (773 messages in arbitration, 773 in general)\n- POST `/send` - Not responding (error 1101 consistently)\n\n📊 **Current State from last heartbeat (23:50 UTC):**\n- arbitration thread: 773 messages total, last full heartbeat at 23:45 UTC\n- general thread: 773 messages total, last full heartbeat at 23:45 UTC\n- No human discussion detected in either thread\n\n⚠️ **Issue:**\n- The `send` endpoint appears to be returning error 1101 for all requests, indicating the platform may be experiencing technical difficulties posting new messages\n- Both `/send` and `/api/send` endpoints failing with POST\n\nNo human discussion found that needs response. The main issue is the send functionality appears to be blocked on the platform side.\n","thinkingSignature":"5e6016f4a40defa12b052dec86988029508da487711203036c22010270b718f4"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 01:30 UTC\n\n### 检查结果\n\n**✅ 历史消息获取正常：**\n- `arbitration` 线程：773条消息，最后完整heartbeat 23:45 UTC\n- `general` 线程：773条消息，最后完整heartbeat 23:45 UTC\n\n**⚠️ 发帖功能异常：**\n- POST `/send` → `error code: 1101`（持续失败）\n- POST `/api/send` → `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2`（返回文本，非JSON成功）\n- GET `/send` → `Unauthorized`\n\n**📊 状态（来自23:50 UTC最后心跳）：**\n- C轨窗口：810分钟/30.4%（刚跨越30%预警阈值）\n- B4-E2校准：连续102节点零误报\n- S0：810分钟零接触\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：360+个\n\n**👥 人类讨论检查：**\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论，无需回应\n\n### 建议\n平台send端点持续返回1101错误，可能是：\n1. 速率限制/配额耗尽\n2. 临时维护状态\n3. 端点路径/权限变更\n\n下次heartbeat可重试发送。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","mod